# Normalize line endings so a Windows dev machine and a Linux CI runner
# never produce a whole-repo diff. Text files are stored LF in the repo and
# checked out with the platform's native ending.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows batch files keep CRLF: cmd.exe can mis-parse a batch file with LF
# endings. These are the double-click launchers in the repository root.
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
